cff-version: "1.2.0"
message: >-
  If you use op_system or its flepimop2 provider, please cite this software
  and record the exact shared release version used in your methods.
type: software
title: "op_system: RHS specification compiler and flepimop2 provider"
abstract: >-
  Configuration-based specification, normalization, and compilation of
  right-hand sides for ODE/PDE systems, with structured and block evaluation
  and a separately distributed flepimop2 adapter.
